# GitHub personal access token used by the commit-history section.
# Optional: without it the graph falls back to a public, no-auth contributions
# API (public contributions only). With it, the section reads GitHub's GraphQL
# API directly and can include private-repo contributions when the profile has
# "Private contributions" enabled.
#
# Classic token with the `read:user` scope, or a fine-grained token with
# read-only access to your profile: https://github.com/settings/tokens
GITHUB_TOKEN=
